r-026","block":"b-c746afce98646ef06fd1","layer":"original","quote":"敕令还击比能，杀比能弟苴罗侯，及叛乌丸归义侯王同、王寄等〖9〗；大结怨仇","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":237,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":70},{"id":"mingdi-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-55fe0d03372d16080ee1","layer":"original","quote":"保塞鲜卑大人步度根，与叛鲜卑大人轲比能私通〖9〗。并州刺史毕轨表〖10〗：“辄出军以外威比能〖11〗，内镇步度根。”帝省表曰〖12〗：“步度根以为比能所诱〖13〗，有自疑心。今轨出军，适使二部惊合为一；何所威镇乎？促敕轨：已出军者，慎勿越塞过句注也〖14〗！”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"mingdi-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100},{"id":"mingdi-q-o032","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-55fe0d03372d16080ee1","layer":"original","quote":"保塞鲜卑大人步度根，与叛鲜卑大人轲比能私通〖9〗。并州刺史毕轨表〖10〗：“辄出军以外威比能〖11〗，内镇步度根。”帝省表曰〖12〗：“步度根以为比能所诱〖13〗，有自疑心。今轨出军，适使二部惊合为一；何所威镇乎？促敕轨：已出军者，慎勿越塞过句注也〖14〗！”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"mingdi-q-o033","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110},{"id":"mingdi-q-o035","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-6d90bf5a6b24809ceff4","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，步度根部落大人戴胡阿狼泥等，诣并州降。朗引军还。﹝二﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118},{"id":"wuhuan-q-02ebfd28c266a4a6c652","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-be79ed42c10f35995307","layer":"original","quote":"后与东部鲜卑大人素利及步度根三部争斗，更相攻击","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":98,"end":121},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0364b595e9ceeba2c64c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"比能遣子将骑与尚等会战于楼烦〖27〗，临阵害尚、弼","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":54,"end":79},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0aec8ed3a64c6cf1f7b0","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"步度根遣使献马","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":38},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0c33236972926888ca1c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"后数与轲比能更相攻击","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":54},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0fc2662f73a2f4146403","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"帝拜为王","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":39,"end":43},{"id":"wuhuan-q-24e2c87728081f6b3abd","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"步度根部众稍寡弱，将其众万余落保太原、雁门郡","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":77},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4e5b794871d787144741","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"步度根为比能所杀","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":123,"end":131},{"id":"wuhuan-q-604235d65ce57b8377c3","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-6c30f7f2ead157650caf","layer":"original","quote":"毕轨有陉北之败","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":83},{"id":"wuhuan-q-6ca61334f7acba91263f","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"至黄初五年，步度根诣阙贡献，厚加赏赐","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":167,"end":185},{"id":"wuhuan-q-854aecb455d4435ff533","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"步度根乃使人招呼泄归泥曰：“汝父为比能所杀，不念报仇，反属怨家〖8〗。今虽厚待汝，是欲杀汝计也；不如还我，我与汝是骨肉至亲，岂与仇等","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":144},{"id":"wuhuan-q-8b996a18b7c4c670f4e6","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-c7f229fe35499fa53b78","layer":"original","quote":"由是归泥将其部落逃归步度根，比能追之弗及","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":146,"end":166},{"id":"wuhuan-q-9268fe8fe10c45992137","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"于是步度根将泄归泥及部众悉保比能，寇抄并州，杀略吏民","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":70},{"id":"wuhuan-q-aa52aedce4cd6cb7c0e5","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"至青龙元年，比能诱步度根深结和亲","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":43},{"id":"wuhuan-q-ae55384974ac4fbeb031","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-9645db70fdcab791efc2","layer":"original","quote":"步度根既立，众稍衰弱","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":6,"end":16},{"id":"wuhuan-q-ccc4ec5670ac83886d33","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-b719f989159c76febbc6","layer":"pei","quote":"魁头死，弟步度根代立","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":111,"end":121},{"id":"wuhuan-q-cfb1d29c968d96de0767","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"帝遣骁骑将军秦朗征之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":81},{"id":"wuhuan-q-f00b267e79948e49cdc8","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-7a2407d2753b29e36a3a","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，太祖定幽州，步度根与轲比能等因乌丸校尉阎柔上贡献","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"wuhuan-q-f42b76494c032a70f83e","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"至青龙元年，比能诱纳步度根，使叛并州，与结和亲","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
